 food is prepared in refrigerated room, if practice has regulatory approval, or UTENSILS stored in 135F water. (E) Surfaces of UTENSILS and EQUIPMENT contacting food shall be cleaned any time contamination occurs, at least 24 hours for certain UTENSILS (i.e. iced tea dispensers), before restocking self-service EQUIPMENT, in EQUIPMENT such as ice bins in frequency to prevent mold. At a frequency to preclude accumulation of soil or mold.","citation":"","citation_text":""},{"item":48,"title":"Warewashing facilities: installed, maintained, & used; test strips","repeat":false,"comment":"Test strips were not located in the facility for the sanitizer tablets in the kitchen.  Quarternary sanitizer tablets are on-site, although no test strips are available. Ensure the appropriate test strips are obtained to measure the concentration of sanitizer.\n\n4-302.14: A test kit or other device that accurately measures the concentration in MG/L of SANITIZING solutions shall be provided.","citation":"","citation_text":""},{"item":55,"title":"Physical facilities installed, maintained, and clean","repeat":false,"comment":"Numerous ceiling tiles are missing in the basement.  Discussed with the member present.  Ensure the ceiling tiles are replaced.\n\n6-501.11: PHYSICAL FACILITIES shall be maintained in good repair.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"392483","date":"2021-07-29","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9060&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=392483&INSPECTION_NN=392483","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"368124","date":"2020-08-11","visit":"Spot check","type_raw":"Spot Check","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9060&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=3